# Where contact-form leads are delivered (Slack, Make, Zapier, Google Apps Script, CRM…).
# Receives a JSON POST: { "text": "New lead: …", "lead": { name, phone, email, interests, plan, source, receivedAt } }
# Required in production — without it /api/contact returns 503 instead of silently dropping leads.
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Optional: build into a separate folder so a verification build doesn't clash with a running `npm run dev`.
# NEXT_DIST_DIR=.next-verify
